{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世間はシルバーウィーク中ですが、\nOLアイドル新内眞衣は\n休みなしで稼働中です〜〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはシルバーウィークに\n旅行とかに行ったりするのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったらシルバーウィークの\nお土産話、聞かせて下さいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の土日は握手会でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日は\n全国握手会&セブンイレブンライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セブンイレブンライブの方は\n久しぶりにライブが出来て\n楽しかったな〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアー中もたくさんセブンイレブンに\n行ったから思い出深いんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏はセブンイレブンと\n駆け抜けたと言っても\n過言ではないかな(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーんて♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして握手の方では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアがらりんさん(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましてさんも\nらりん一家の皆さんも\n私のファンの皆さんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんだったからか\n終始笑いの絶えない楽しい握手会でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、次の日は\n個別握手会♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東の方はかなりお久しぶりでしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん変わらずの元気そうで\n安心しました〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにね\n3部には季節外れの浴衣を着たの♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会がないと\n中々見せる機会がなかったので\n夏の終わりに着れて良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都、名古屋とは違う浴衣を着たけど\nどうだったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう普段とは違うものが着れるのも\n握手会の醍醐味ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからまた10月には\nハロウィン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"があるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月にはクリスマス〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から何を着ようか考えているの！\nリクエストなんかもあったりしたら\n教えてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもとは少し違った私と\n会いましょう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全ての犬は天国へ行く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今更ですが...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キービジュアルが公開されました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん見てくれましたか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか\n私の面影があまりないみたいで笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの人から\nまいちゅんドコにいるの？？？\nと聞かれる事案が大量に発生しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに私っぽくないかな？笑\nメイクって素晴らしいね〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに舞台の方は\n絶賛お稽古中でして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初舞台の新内は\n悪戦苦闘しまくっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日まで、なんと！！！\nあと10日を切りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどん高いレベルのものを\n要求されるのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかんせん、自信がないもので、\n本当に不安でいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこんな機会滅多にないので、\nたくさん吸収して\n挑みたいと思います！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれる方は\n楽しみにしていて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週プレさん乃木坂46特集"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今発売中の週刊プレボーイさんで\n乃木坂46の大特集をして頂いてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中で、私は伊織とペアで\nグラビアをやらせて頂きました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて男性物の下着ラインの\nBODY WILDさんと\nコラボレーションさせて頂きました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構エッジの効いた写真に\nなっていると思いますが\n皆さんどうでしたかね？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いっきりかっこよく撮って頂けたので、\n良かったら見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の方のページにいます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも乃木坂の魅力がたっぷり詰まった\n写真たちが紙面を飾っているので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非GETしてみて下さい*\\(^o^)/*\nよろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/21/3706484/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から何を着るか考えてるよ〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエストの多いツインテール\nやろうかな、、、(小声)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます♪"}],"source":"archive"}